# PRock03 (Plain Rock asylum) route: the item103e west cell-block -> checkpoint -> guard cine ->
# magnetic card -> `porte_sec` -> `prsas02` airlock chain, ending at the east airlock reader.
#
# No teleports, no weapon/item/goal bridges: every step is player input through the game's own
# movement/use/fire chain.
#
# item103j (coordinator round; measured, local/re/item103i/ward-seeplayer-solo1..7.txt): under
# retail SeePlayer delivery (origin/main 0b5988c) this route stops at the last measured safe
# point - the east airlock reader `MagneticPassTrigger3` (-2755,760), read at t=91.2/91.8 -
# BEFORE crossing the `Door2` movers. The next step of the route (the cache corridor, y~900)
# crosses inside cine `Cine12`'s sight: Cine12 patrols the corridor at (-2267..-2351,907..911)
# with SightRadius 800, the crossing waypoint (-2816,959) lies ~470-530 UU from it with a clear
# sight line through the open `Door2` gap, and the measured `SeePlayer` deliveries fire during
# the crossing (t=111.5 standing, t=111.7 crouched) in every run. Cine12 and `BaseSoldier4`
# then hunt the corridor at 10-15 hp/s with hit stagger; the player is unarmed there (the
# level's only weapon, `MagnumPick0`, lies past the corridor behind `Porte43`), so the arming
# run cannot be made input-only yet - six closed-loop variants (early walk, recorded idle, a
# Door2-gap wait gate, a west retreat into the airlock, a south-lane detour, a crouched detour)
# all died 144 -> 0 hp, and the checkpoint guard wanders out of punch range. The route pins the
# pre-crossing state (the test reads Cine12's position/SightRadius from the VM).
#
# Proven phases (all input):
#   t=0.5..30.5   the west cell-block: the doors `Porte33/35/40/42` opened with the player's own
#                 use, the walk to the checkpoint.
#   t=31..95      the key-chain block (prock03_key_chain.script, SeePlayer-green): hold at the
#                 checkpoint until the guard cine itself opens `Porte30` (its SeeXIII reaction
#                 restarts the cine when the player is seen - do not pre-empt the opener), the
#                 strongbox loop (the `Hual02MagneticCard` pickup), `Porte30` re-opened on the
#                 way back, the aimed card read on `MagneticPassTrigger0` (opening the
#                 TriggerControl `Porte29`), then the sprint crossing of the `Cine0` corridor so
#                 the player is >800 UU east before Cine0's ~110.4-112.3 look window, and the
#                 airlock card read on `MagneticPassTrigger3`.
t=0.50 goto -1246 2604
t=2.50 goto -1476 2543
t=4.00 goto -1680 2464
t=5.00 use Porte33
t=6.00 goto -1857 2527
t=7.50 goto -2106 2563
t=9.00 goto -2228 2552
t=10.50 goto -2339 2530
t=12.00 goto -2539 2582
t=13.50 goto -2592 2597
t=15.00 goto -2728 2656
t=16.00 use Porte35
t=17.00 goto -2909 2590
t=19.00 goto -3296 2388
t=20.00 use Porte40
t=21.00 goto -3357 2216
t=22.50 goto -3456 2157
t=24.00 goto -3652 1984
t=25.00 use Porte42
t=26.00 goto -3468 2051
t=27.50 goto -3764 2043
t=29.00 goto -3790 2016
t=30.50 goto -3840 1720
# item100j/key-chain block (proven under SeePlayer): hold at the checkpoint, outside the guard
# cone, until the guard's own cine opens Porte30 (its SeeXIII reaction restarts the cine when
# the player is seen - do not pre-empt the opener), then the strongbox loop on the compressed
# post-wait stamps, Porte30 re-opened on the way back, the card read, and the Cine0 sprint.
t=31.00 wait_until event Porte30 PlayerTrigger 40
t=33.50 goto -3820 1922
t=34.59 goto -3797 2129
t=36.78 goto -3576 2515
t=38.61 goto -3391 2828
t=40.07 goto -3385 3022
t=41.16 goto -3360 3138
t=45.55 goto -3436 3358
t=49.20 goto -3604 3627
t=50.29 goto -3862 3758
t=51.38 goto -3872 3810
t=57.22 goto -3862 3758
t=60.14 goto -3436 3358
t=63.06 goto -3360 3138
t=64.53 use Porte30
t=67.44 goto -3379 3138
t=70.37 goto -3391 2828
t=73.28 goto -3576 2515
t=76.20 goto -3797 2129
t=79.85 goto -3840 1720
t=81.80 track MagneticPassTrigger0
t=82.80 use MagneticPassTrigger0
t=83.80 use MagneticPassTrigger0
t=84.80 use MagneticPassTrigger0
t=85.80 use MagneticPassTrigger0
t=86.00 track off
# item100k: Cine0 (CineController25) is `XIDCine.Cine2` with map SightRadius 800 and
# PeripheralVision -0.1 (a 191-degree cone). It looks at the checkpoint from the north-east
# only for ~1.4 s at ~110.4-111.7 and again at 112.3. Sprint immediately after the card read
# and clear the airlock (>800 east) before it turns.
t=86.10 goto -3778 1592
t=86.70 goto -3682 1536
t=87.30 goto -3592 1403
t=88.30 goto -3216 1072
t=89.30 goto -2960 846
t=89.80 goto -2817 1000
t=90.30 goto -2780 790
t=90.80 goto -2755 760
t=91.20 use MagneticPassTrigger3
t=91.80 use MagneticPassTrigger3
# The stop: the next route step (the Door2 crossing at (-2816,959)) lies inside cine Cine12's
# sight (see the header). The route pins the pre-crossing state and stops here.
t=92.00 forward 0
